OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'terrified' in hometown
OL,4,Aafter purse snatched
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pensioner has been left "terrified"
OL,7,Fto walk around her hometown after her
OL,8,Fpurse was snatched by a robber, a court
OL,9,Fhas heard.
OL,11,FPeyman Afrasiyabipour, 27, was quickly
OL,12,Fapprehended by several residents after
OL,13,Frobbing the 69-year-old woman in South
OL,14,FShields in July, Newcastle Crown Court
OL,15,Fheard.
OL,17,FThe woman, who was recovering from
OL,18,Fbreast cancer, said "elderly people
OL,19,Fdeserve the right to feel safe when
OL,20,Fwalking the streets in broad daylight".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
