OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'terrified' in hometown
OL,4,Aafter purse snatched
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfrasiyabipour was jailed for two
OL,7,Fyears, suspended for two and a half
OL,8,Fyears, after admitting robbery. A judge
OL,9,Fsaid it was a "pity" the asylum seeker
OL,10,Ffrom Iran had "repaid the generosity"
OL,11,Fof the UK by committing crime.
